{"lines": [{"text": "Your earbuds can make a jet engine go quiet.", "start": 0.3, "end": 2.796}, {"text": "Not by blocking the sound, but by adding more sound.", "start": 2.946, "end": 6.162}, {"text": "A tiny microphone on the outside listens to the noise around you.", "start": 6.562, "end": 10.503}, {"text": "A chip makes a copy of that sound wave, flipped upside down.", "start": 10.853, "end": 14.493}, {"text": "Where the noise pushes on your eardrum, the copy pulls.", "start": 14.793, "end": 17.845}, {"text": "The two cancel out, before the noise ever reaches you.", "start": 18.195, "end": 21.198}, {"text": "A second microphone inside your ear catches whatever slips through, and cancels that too.", "start": 21.548, "end": 26.585}, {"text": "It works best on steady, low hums, like engines and air conditioners.", "start": 26.935, "end": 31.208}], "total": 31.208, "words": [{"w": "Your", "s": 0.3, "e": 0.569, "line": 0}, {"w": "earbuds", "s": 0.569, "e": 0.985, "line": 0}, {"w": "can", "s": 0.985, "e": 1.205, "line": 0}, {"w": "make", "s": 1.205, "e": 1.475, "line": 0}, {"w": "a", "s": 1.475, "e": 1.597, "line": 0}, {"w": "jet", "s": 1.597, "e": 1.817, "line": 0}, {"w": "engine", "s": 1.817, "e": 2.184, "line": 0}, {"w": "go", "s": 2.184, "e": 2.356, "line": 0}, {"w": "quiet.", "s": 2.356, "e": 2.796, "line": 0}, {"w": "Not", "s": 2.946, "e": 3.183, "line": 1}, {"w": "by", "s": 3.183, "e": 3.368, "line": 1}, {"w": "blocking", "s": 3.368, "e": 3.869, "line": 1}, {"w": "the", "s": 3.869, "e": 4.106, "line": 1}, {"w": "sound,", "s": 4.106, "e": 4.58, "line": 1}, {"w": "but", "s": 4.58, "e": 4.818, "line": 1}, {"w": "by", "s": 4.818, "e": 5.002, "line": 1}, {"w": "adding", "s": 5.002, "e": 5.398, "line": 1}, {"w": "more", "s": 5.398, "e": 5.688, "line": 1}, {"w": "sound.", "s": 5.688, "e": 6.162, "line": 1}, {"w": "A", "s": 6.562, "e": 6.696, "line": 2}, {"w": "tiny", "s": 6.696, "e": 6.991, "line": 2}, {"w": "microphone", "s": 6.991, "e": 7.608, "line": 2}, {"w": "on"